  agent_trading_core/memory/reflection.py <- tradingagents/memory/reflection.py

Files adapted (config lookup replaced by explicit arguments, modules merged,
or the graph dependency removed):
  agent_trading_core/snapshot.py      <- tradingagents/dataflows/vendors/yahoo/snapshot.py
  agent_trading_core/yahoo.py         <- vendors/yahoo/{common,ohlcv,market,fundamentals}.py, dataflows/net.py
